/* The board DTS already routes zephyr,console and zephyr,shell-uart to
 * usart2 (PA2/PA3, 115200 8N1), which is the physical wiring on this bench
 * (board PA2(TX) -> CP2102 RX, PA3(RX) -> CP2102 TX, GND -> GND). No override
 * or disable is needed; keeping usart2 active is all the protocol-v1
 * console path requires.
 */
